WEBVTT

00:42:58.913 --> 00:43:01.204
And and I sort of always thought like.

00:43:02.038 --> 00:43:04.788
OK, my my first novel will, of course,

00:43:04.788 --> 00:43:09.288
be published and done and everything by
the time I'm 30, but I, I just said,

00:43:09.288 --> 00:43:12.913
OK, as I was approaching 30, I was like,
OK, this hasn't been done yet.

00:43:12.913 --> 00:43:13.996
And here are the reasons why.

00:43:13.996 --> 00:43:18.913
One is I'm always having to work full time
to pay the bills and to you know,

00:43:18.913 --> 00:43:22.163
it's hard to have that kind of time and
focus when you're working full time.

00:43:22.704 --> 00:43:25.579
So graduate school kind of solve
that problem for me.

00:43:25.579 --> 00:43:29.413
And I only looked into I only applied
to graduate schools that, you know,

00:43:29.621 --> 00:43:33.913
with the idea that I would only go if I
were offered a full a full fellowship